@startuml package
!include _style.iuml
title Диаграмма пакетов — правило зависимостей
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

package "cryptopay" {
  package "domain" as D {
    [payment_intent, checkout_session,\nrefund, ledger, merchant,\nwebhook_endpoint, money, events, errors]
  }
  package "application" as A {
    package "ports" as Ports
    package "services" as Services
    package "events" as Ev
    package "jobs" as Jobs
  }
  package "infrastructure" as I {
    package "http" as Http
    package "postgres" as Pg
    package "memory" as Mem
    package "wallet" as WalletAd
    package "config, auth, webhooks,\nsystem, scheduler" as Misc
  }
  package "mockwallet" as M
  package "container.py\n(корень композиции)" as C
}

A ..> D : import
I ..> A : import
I ..> D : import
WalletAd ..> M : адаптер
C ..> I
C ..> A
C ..> M

note right of D
  Только стандартная библиотека
  (dataclasses, datetime, re, typing).
end note
note right of M
  «Чужая» система: не импортирует
  ничего из cryptopay — ни домен,
  ни сервисы, ни инфраструктуру.
end note
note bottom of A
  Зависимости направлены только внутрь.
  Нарушение ломает tests/test_architecture.py
  (разбор импортов модулем ast).
end note
@enduml
